I'll implement the Decision Model Logs viewer end-to-end: API methods, the new viewer component, a route, a UI-store opener, and the settings-menu entry.

## 1. API — `src/api/modules/analytics.js`

Adds decision-model log endpoints (user + admin scoped) plus self-contained JSDoc typedefs.

